% - - - - - - - - Dance description - - - - - - - -
%%begintext align
%% The 1st Man cast down, and the 2d Wo. Cast up at the
%% same Time, and then cast back again into your own
%% Places .|  First Wo. and 2d Man does the same :|  The
%% 1st Man change Places with the 2d Wo. 1st Wo. does
%% the same with the 2d Man, all four go round to your
%% own Places .|  First and 2d Men Sets to their Partners
%% Right and Left half round.
%%endtext
